---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';

const REGISTER_URL = "https://yinxingren1.invisibleaff.com/#/register?code=Gcp1CRso";
---

<footer class="bg-white border-t border-[#EAEAEA] pt-16 pb-12 text-sm text-[#666666]">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    
    <!-- 4 Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 pb-14 border-b border-[#EAEAEA]">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Slogan (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <Logo />
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-[#222222] tracking-tight">
          让连接更简单。
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#888888] leading-relaxed max-w-[340px]">
          为中文用户打造的极简高效网络连接入口，畅享无感稳定的多端互联体验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: 产品 (2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111111] uppercase tracking-wider">
          产品
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li>
            <a href="#features" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">线路优势</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#nodes" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">节点分布</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#devices" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">支持设备</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#steps" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">使用教程</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: 帮助 (2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111111] uppercase tracking-wider">
          帮助
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li>
            <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">常见问题</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#steps" class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">配置指南</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a 
              href={REGISTER_URL} 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors"
            >
              开始使用
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: 快速入口 (3 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#111111] uppercase tracking-wider">
          快速入口
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#888888]">
          立即创建账户，开启极速连接。
        </p>
        <a 
          href={REGISTER_URL} 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="honor-btn-primary px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium inline-flex items-center shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>立即注册</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-1.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Notice & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-[12px] text-[#888888] leading-relaxed">
        风险说明：第三方网站、应用及网络服务的可访问性可能随地区、线路及服务提供方政策变化，页面内容不构成持续可用性保证。请在遵守当地法律法规的前提下合规使用。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#999999] pt-2">
        <p>© 2026 网际快车. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <span>简约 · 稳定 · 高效</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
